{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子ですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、北海道の親戚に荷物を送るのに\nお父さんの実家とお父さんの妹の家族に\n今年の生誕祭で頂いた\nマグカップを1つずつ送りました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つ頂いたので、\n1つはわたしのお家にあるんだけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その荷物が届いたみたいで\n連絡が来ました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、ファンの方に支えてもらって\nたくさん応援してもらって\n頑張れてるんだよ！！！と伝えられたと\n思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使ってくれるといいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/24/5044284/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/24/5044284/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SamuraiELOさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/24/5044284/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。\nもう時間が迫ってきちゃって\n今日は短いですが。。このへんで。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたかくね！"}],"source":"archive"}